to\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:30px\"><span style=\"color:#808080;font-size:30px\">Create: Quality of Life</span> 是 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><a style=\"font-weight:normal !important;color:#f90;font-size:30px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Mod</a> </span><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此模组为 Create Mod 添加了一些实用功能<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">当前支持的 Create 版本：6.0.10</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol/features\" width=\"1512\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol/chipped_saw\" width=\"1086\" height=\"96\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol/linker\" width=\"1086\" height=\"96\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol/shadow_radiance\" width=\"1086\" height=\"96\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol/schedule\" width=\"1086\" height=\"96\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/541199/description_4e1cb9c4-bc3f-41dd-8136-0e734888fb1f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"133\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">您可以在您的整合包中使用此模组，但请勿将此模组重新发布到其他网站！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> CurseForge